OL,3,GNEWSACall for more support for
OL,4,Achildren's hospices hit by NI hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of a children's hospice
OL,7,Fcharity which "relieves pressure on the
OL,8,FNHS" has appealed for more government
OL,9,Fsupport as the sector faces rising
OL,10,Fcosts and a growing struggle to attract
OL,11,Fdonations.
OL,13,FKevin Clements, chief executive of East
OL,14,FAnglia's Children's Hospices (EACH),
OL,15,Fsaid the increases in National
OL,16,FInsurance (NI) contributions and the
OL,17,FNational Living Wage have cost the
OL,18,Fcharity #1m a year.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
