OL,3,GNEWSACall for more support for
OL,4,Achildren's hospices hit by NI hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FNext week, a report from the Charities
OL,7,FAid Foundation is expected to reveal
OL,8,Fthat nine in every 10 charity leaders
OL,9,Fbelieve the government relies on the
OL,10,Fsector to deliver services it cannot or
OL,11,Fwill not fund.
OL,13,FThe government says hospices do
OL,14,Fincredible work to support people when
OL,15,Fthey need it most.
